WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:05.957
Ivy groaned as Glen went on and on about being a hero in the woods.

2
00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:11.666
"Maybe Glen should do a magic act for the talent show," she mumbled to Ezra.

3
00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:14.541
"Huh?" Ezra said.

4
00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:18.660
"He just turned himself into a superhero," Ivy said.

5
00:00:18.661 --> 00:00:22.457
"And he turned you into a beaver."

6
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:28.283
Ezra crossed his arms. "I never came close to eating tree bark!"

7
00:00:28.284 --> 00:00:32.332
"Try telling Mr. Superhero that," Ivy said.

8
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:38.507
"He's acting like he saved all of our lives." She sighed.

9
00:00:38.508 --> 00:00:45.916
"I have to meet Clara and Willow now. See you later."

10
00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:51.590
As Ivy headed for her cabin, she started thinking about her talent show problem again.

11
00:00:51.591 --> 00:00:55.125
"I don't care what Clara says," she thought.

12
00:00:55.126 --> 00:00:58.082
"Why can't drawing be my act?

13
00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:04.063
I can draw really fast, and everybody loves to see zombies and vampires.

14
00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:11.561
Clara and Willow can do their own act."

15
00:01:11.562 --> 00:01:16.421
"Ivy!" Clara burst out as Ivy entered the cabin.

16
00:01:16.422 --> 00:01:19.541
"We have the best idea ever!"

17
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:22.832
"I've been thinking too, and—" Ivy began.

18
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:30.832
"We're going to do a song with our own dance moves!" Willow said. "It'll be amazing!"

19
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:33.841
Clara tossed a pile of clothes on her bunk.

20
00:01:33.842 --> 00:01:38.944
"I'm picking our costumes. We can dress like pop stars!"

21
00:01:38.945 --> 00:01:45.082
"I'm working on our dance moves," Willow spun in a circle and snapped her fingers.

22
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:51.127
Ivy tried again. "I, um, think I'm going to—"

23
00:01:51.128 --> 00:01:54.459
"You're the creative type," Clara said.

24
00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.011
"You can write a song for us."

25
00:01:58.012 --> 00:02:01.500
"But I like to draw," Ivy said.

26
00:02:01.502 --> 00:02:05.416
"Not write songs. So why don't I—"

27
00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:10.525
"Just make sure the song is about love!" Clara said dreamily.

28
00:02:10.526 --> 00:02:14.499
"All the best pop songs are about love."

29
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.355
"Grr!" Ivy thought in frustration.

30
00:02:18.356 --> 00:02:24.207
Clara and Willow were not listening to her. Not at all.

31
00:02:24.208 --> 00:02:28.166
There was no way out of this now. Unless . . .

32
00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:31.657
Suddenly she had a fabulous idea.

33
00:02:31.658 --> 00:02:37.580
"I'll write a song so creepy and weird, they'll hate it!" Ivy thought.

34
00:02:37.581 --> 00:02:41.285
She chuckled to herself.

35
00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:44.666
"They won't want me in their group anymore.

36
00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:49.129
Then I can do a drawing act—all by myself!"

37
00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:52.509
Ivy had written poems before.

38
00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:56.189
She figured writing songs wouldn't be very different.

39
00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:00.569
Humming to herself, she began to write down words.

40
00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:04.743
Willow moved around the cabin, trying out dance moves.

41
00:03:04.744 --> 00:03:07.812
Clara held up a pair of pink shorts.

42
00:03:07.813 --> 00:03:10.253
"What should we call our group?

43
00:03:10.254 --> 00:03:15.249
How about CGB for Cute Girls Band?"

44
00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.806
"I like that," Willow said.

45
00:03:17.807 --> 00:03:23.035
"But what do you think of Thrice? Because there are three of us.

46
00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:26.739
Or maybe Ever for Camp Evergreen?"

47
00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:31.746
Clara looked at Ivy. "Which group name do you like best?"

48
00:03:31.747 --> 00:03:36.574
"Well." Ivy did a quick drawing in her sketch pad.

49
00:03:36.575 --> 00:03:42.374
"How about we call ourselves Vampyre?"

50
00:03:42.375 --> 00:03:45.637
She showed the other girls her drawing.

51
00:03:45.638 --> 00:03:48.488
"We can wear makeup like this."

52
00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:54.874
The picture showed them with scary white faces, dark eyes, and bright red lips.

53
00:03:54.875 --> 00:03:57.723
Her two cabinmates looked shocked.

54
00:03:57.724 --> 00:04:05.791
"Um . . . okay," Clara said. "Maybe that's an idea. How's the song coming?"

55
00:04:05.792 --> 00:04:10.999
"Great!" Ivy said. "What do you think of this?"

56
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.750
I'm hiding in the dark.

57
00:04:14.751 --> 00:04:17.306
Your love scares me.

58
00:04:17.307 --> 00:04:20.554
How you dare me.

59
00:04:20.555 --> 00:04:23.626
You really stole my heart.

60
00:04:23.627 --> 00:04:26.418
Your love chills me.

61
00:04:26.419 --> 00:04:29.103
Yes, it thrills me.

62
00:04:29.104 --> 00:04:33.124
It hurts me.

63
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:45.585
Owie, owie, ow! Owie, owie, ow!

64
00:04:45.586 --> 00:04:51.207
Ivy looked up. Clara and Willow were completely still.

65
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:56.793
"They're so horrified, they don't know what to say!" Ivy thought gleefully.

66
00:04:56.794 --> 00:04:59.964
"I knew this was a brilliant plan!"

67
00:04:59.965 --> 00:05:02.187
Then Clara let out a shout.

68
00:05:02.188 --> 00:05:08.540
"Wow, Ivy! That's the greatest song ever!"

